hostlibs/<platform>/ - libraries built against the DEVICE's own glibc, loaded by
apkenv with the real dlopen() and bridged into the bionic namespace by
compat/hostlib.c.

Do NOT put these in libs/<platform>/. That directory is APKENV_LOCAL_BIONIC_PATH,
the search path of apkenv's *bionic* linker, and packaging/build-ipk.sh copies
*.so out of it into the jail's bionic lib dir. These are glibc objects; they must
never be handed to the bionic linker.

  webos/libmono-webos.so   Unity's Mono 2.6.5 runtime (Unity-Technologies/mono
                           @ unity3.5, commit 64c3378a), built by
                           tools/build-mono-webos.sh. Stands in for the bionic
                           libmono.so inside templerun2_1.2.1.apk, whose export
                           set it matches exactly (910 symbols, zero diff).
